  "id": "voluntary-behavior",
  "term": "voluntary behavior",
  "definition": "Voluntary behavior is action a person performs actively by choice rather than because of compulsion or pressure. In this source, it is contrasted with behavior that may appear initiative-based but is actually driven by compulsory workplace forces.",
